      "text": "Just landed in Newark and the love from you guys hits different. \n\nPeople stopping me left and right, shaking my hand, thanking me for the work — that’s what keeps me going. \n\nThere’s definitely a silent majority out there. \n\nWe will never give in to a silent few that make noise and destroy cities because the bulk of us see it our way. \n\nReal Americans who appreciate someone actually doing something about it. \n\nGrateful for every one of you. \n\nLet’s get this done. 💪",
